<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
    Polish. The same keys as values/strings.xml, which explains each; see there.
    A stage is an "etap" and the bat's level a "poziom", so the two stay apart as they do in English.
    Each boss falls in its own words because the word agrees with it: the queen and the Naga are
    "pokonana", the imp and the wyrm "pokonany". A number on a card is put before "do" or "pkt",
    which reads the same whatever the number is.
-->
